    rdfs:label "Declare a FAIR Compendium of Contributed Knowledge";
    skos:changeNote "Agent and guided-choice fields that must refer to existing resources are now also external URI placeholders, so Nanodash no longer offers to mint a typed plain name locally for them: agent.";
